{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：23:00 2026-10-11 HKT</p>\n\n<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》今晚（11日）播出第六集，輪到陳若思（Amber）的「甜品飯腳」角力戰，今集的闖關遊戲為「大隻」，玩法是由三位闖關勇者接力「公主抱」陳若思繞場一周。最終由吳兆麟（Alan）、關經翰（Oswald）及林子朗（阿朗）獲得闖關名額，但三位男士在「公主抱」期間，手部均貼住陳若思胸部下方位置，成為焦點。</p>\n<h2>陳若思擇偶條件「好變態」</h2>\n<p>陳若思在節目中公開大膽的擇偶條件，直言對男士「胳肋底以下嘅肌肉」情有獨鍾，認為該處的肌肉與肋骨線條組合極具性感魅力，更害羞笑言自己「好似好變態」。為投其所好，節目組安排吳兆麟、關經翰及林子朗脫去上衣，大騷健碩身材，引得在場女嘉賓尖叫連連，現場曖昧指數爆燈。</p>\n<p>吳兆麟、關經翰及林子朗分別抱起陳若思時，為穩固身軀，手掌都不約而同地緊緊貼住陳若思的下胸位置，畫面令人心跳加速。三人更需一邊角力，一邊在陳若思耳邊講悄悄話示愛。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳若思大談對男士的特別喜好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/469c7d71726b0f57904df1b19af90b99/2026-10/ca8fa0c8-0fe3-4feb-8121-c6a3507d4cd8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳若思的甜品闖關遊戲為「大隻」，玩法是三位闖關勇者需合力「公主抱」Amber「繞場一周」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7265775724cdf662f386fce067e0b895/2026-10/07_2_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳若思全程大派心心眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e28760d0740038b9977c2592a4e299a0/2026-10/08a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳兆麟成為三位闖關勇者之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eba82195d8125b156568a3b5def97f6a/2026-10/02_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三位求愛勇被要求脫去外套及T恤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/471b8a46c6047192bdc57fe1fc1c0aa5/2026-10/TVB_3__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林子朗除爽快照做。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec6cf040850c1f5667c584f674f03767/2026-10/10_1_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關經翰（Oswald）大擺晒肌甫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23222e6bfbc444f77824ec55707efdb8/2026-10/11_0_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳兆麟（Alan）遇強敵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bedfad9eaf7d79d3126f441c699cf765/2026-10/12_3_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何沛珈睇得肉緊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7160205b9e11b6dee0ab86f802f274b3/2026-10/13_4_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭珮文繼續發揮天然呆，以另類方式搶鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ddff2353e5d368de433aa445f6d9ab6/2026-10/14_3_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"五位女神同場陷入尖叫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35f3722c9d6424abbaff5003136eec52/2026-10/15_3_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Amber陳若思扮冇眼睇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77184f8a49fdcf2fbaad1df2323e547c/2026-10/19_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Amber陳若思表現怕醜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36db9759f7f8767d6f8d9f3587794c98/2026-10/20_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳若思站在台上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7317af43142d7e34b53e5d9aa020d5f/2026-10/TVB_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳兆麟第一個抱起陳若思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c390cac9a46306a2f1d8176c4672680e/2026-10/23_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳兆麟的手掌貼近陳若思的胸部。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdacd7d70a53f49183e6a04375074039/2026-10/TVB_20__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"另一角度見到吳兆麟的手貼住陳若思下胸位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/785c2c97fd4d8fcc93b36e3e855e8833/2026-10/TVB_26__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳兆麟小心翼翼地將陳若思交到接力的關經翰手上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c3d9b9e4b80358f16f03dd9c9f5601b/2026-10/24_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關經翰同樣手掌貼住陳若思下胸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15de95dccca271c8da22d5391c218365/2026-10/TVB_29__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關經翰抱得好實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f30fafc5e61368e703d95e613f307e2/2026-10/TVB_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關經翰抱起陳若思繞場一周。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/332c60cb87d87d0eb60d4dae0580c051/2026-10/25_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關經翰放下陳若思時隻手仍未放低。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e420d3cd67ad3fc013093073362e425/2026-10/TVB_35__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林子朗的手掌亦貼近陳若思下胸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/148478e197749d993f3c583bf85e8ee6/2026-10/TVB_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林子朗揚言「唔會畀Amber受到傷害」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12ad8ede363bc67df5db83a1781829c1/2026-10/26_7.jpg\"/>\n<h2>吳兆麟叫陳若思「放鬆啲」</h2>\n<p>吳兆麟率先許下承諾：「放鬆啲，我會畀最大嘅安全感你。」緊接其後的關經翰先是輕聲問陳若思是否準備好，才慢慢抱起女方並表示：「我會用情感同心靈去默默支持你。」而最後的林子朗則深情告白：「我唔會畀Amber受到傷害。」真誠的表白最終打動陳若思，並在三位勇士中選擇了林子朗。陳若思解釋林子朗給予自己最強烈的安全感。</p>\n<img alt=\"花生團成員Amber閨密Sam Lau（劉倬昕）、Juliana閨密鄧凱文（Eris）、Mandy閨密鄧依婷、Roxanne閨密游嘉欣及Kanis家姐，以及「玄學天后」雲文子師傅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90da5ad054753897d2c4560c434ad279/2026-10/31_0_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"五位女神亦有機會隨時被淘汰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8cbf77528589c5592fca1e96318b885/2026-10/33_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程（Kanis）身材吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f21724c24c804a3db9d461a76756b23/2026-10/29Kanis_Oscar_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"方智弘（Oscar）笑容燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ef6d01a4fcdf089398a365c1dea5bb6/2026-10/30Kanis_Oscar_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"靚仔Oscar。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/367515a53a1c846a8bcf87264910561a/2026-10/33Kanis_Oscar_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"除咗笑聲笑聲，仲有源源不絕讚美之聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d56575529711fb46f5390b89942357c6/2026-10/34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩人好投契。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8431a430599ba4d946145f85f875cefb/2026-10/36_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"睇相都可以睇得咁開心，仲唔係粉紅泡泡攻頂？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/717717d6f0ea435aa780daf56234202a/2026-10/37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Kanis專誠預備了一本「成長相簿」開心Share。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdaf69533e50a0c06e9949e0de480477/2026-10/38_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar好受落。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc8e1d6c6145849be124a85974d01ecb/2026-10/40_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"笑到見牙唔見眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ec6879d549f9015171796baac55b52c/2026-10/41_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Kanis同Oscar傾得好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faf695362dae982548dc39ccba12116d/2026-10/43_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程晒童年相驚呼與Oscar撞樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f5a0b6c994c0335f5d27f27c323d93b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-09_at_15_22_28_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Oscar自爆由細到大被話似女仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d61127462ad817725f09263274030e02/2026-10/44_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一齊玩自拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1a061cc0374f4e299152bedd95d47b1/2026-10/47_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Preston餵阿Ju食拿破崙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eee1bf3daf052010c4287c9bf6e84487/2026-10/03Preston_Ju_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"阿Ju個樣勁可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2bcf9580a93cd608fdd0a3d477fb309/2026-10/04_Ju_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當阿Ju話專誠整咗個芝士蛋糕畀自己試吓，Preston開心到眼都凸埋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4534f1ef856af597b804aea9be05fdd/2026-10/07_Ju_Preston_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Preston真係極之欣賞！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27d17ee2b99707156c571be991f7cabf/2026-10/10__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Preston一嚟就畀100分，𠱁到阿Ju好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ebfe3505496157ef3ab67497a609bda/2026-10/12Preston_100_Ju_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"阿Ju開心到暈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffd50ea51ed27649271674fcde23675f/2026-10/14Preston_100_Ju_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"呢幾個畫面，好靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/437c3db5f32a74b2a474a8f82a7550b4/2026-10/22_Ju_Ice_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Preston雖然直球問Ice同Ju關係，但全程緊張到耷晒頭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a175308e76f6c02faf68ed3043dcff1/2026-10/27Preston_Ju_Pure_True_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Preston同Ju都係愛貓之人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8671e838e45901c5e2a9979f97de1ce/2026-10/19Preston_Ju_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T17:38:33.212363+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":580,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}